      "id": "claim_3d313f0084924283a267e473582e021a",
      "statement": "The providers orchestrate services: OnecommPaymentServiceProvider.paymentPurchase calls PaymentService.insert for the created payment and PaymentService.update with the PSP response, then AuthorizationService.insert when the PSP requires authorization; refund flows call PaymentService.get first to validate an approved purchase before RefundService.insert and RefundService.update.",
